  "notes": "いずれ has multiple uses as adverb and pronoun.\n\nAS ADVERB (someday):\n- いずれ + verb (someday will ~)\n- いずれ{近|ちか}いうちに (sometime soon)\n\nAS PRONOUN (which):\n- いずれも (both, all, either)\n- いずれか (one of them, either)\n- いずれにしても/いずれにせよ (in any case)\n\nWRITING:\n- Can be written as {何|いず}れ or {孰|いず}れ (rare)\n- Usually written in hiragana",
